sp("about","About FileMoss","About FileMoss: free, private browser-based tools for office work.","<p>FileMoss is a collection of free tools for everyday office work—PDFs, images, spreadsheets, text, dates and pay. We built it because most “free online converters” upload your documents to unknown servers. FileMoss does the work inside your browser instead, using well-known open-source libraries: <a href='https://pdf-lib.js.org/'>pdf-lib</a>, Mozilla's <a href='https://mozilla.github.io/pdf.js/'>pdf.js</a>, <a href='https://sheetjs.com/'>SheetJS</a>, heic2any and qrcode-generator.</p><h2>Accuracy</h2><p>Calculators show the formula they use, and every tool is covered by automated tests that run before each update. If you find a mistake, please <a href='/contact/'>tell us</a>.</p><h2>Limitations</h2><p>Results are provided as-is. Pay and overtime figures are gross amounts and not legal or tax advice.</p>")
sp("privacy","Privacy Policy","FileMoss privacy policy.",f"<p><i>Last updated: October 20, 2026</i></p><h2>Your files and text</h2><p>All FileMoss tools process files and text locally in your web browser. Files you select, text you paste and numbers you enter are not uploaded to, or stored on, our servers.</p><h2>Hosting and logs</h2><p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which may process technical data such as IP addresses for security and performance, as described in Cloudflare's privacy policy.</p><h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>We do not currently set cookies. In the future we may show ads (for example via Google AdSense). Third-party vendors, including Google, may then use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href='https://adssettings.google.com'>Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href='https://www.aboutads.info'>aboutads.info</a>. This policy will be updated before any such service is enabled.</p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Some pages may in future contain clearly disclosed affiliate links, at no extra cost to you.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy: <a href='mailto:{EM}'>{EM}</a>.</p>")
